From 630bc8b24b4793ca9cdce577b6e29ccc05a8508f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucaci32u4 <lucaci32u4@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:23:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Render plugin panels in the group and user drawers;
 export RoleTable from the UI library

GroupDrawer and UserDrawer fetch plugin panels via usePluginPanels
(ModelType.group / ModelType.user) and render them as additional
accordion items. RoleTable moves to the UI library (@inventreedb/ui) with
optional 'endpoint' (default: ruleset_list), 'api' and 'onSave' props so
plugins can reuse it. Core behaviour is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
